public class UnionFindForKruskal { int[] p; UnionFindForKruskal(int n){p=new int[n];for(int i=0;i<n;i++)p[i]=i;} int find(int x){return p[x]==x?x:(p[x]=find(p[x]));} void union(int a,int b){p[find(a)]=find(b);} public static void run(){UnionFindForKruskal u=new UnionFindForKruskal(3);u.union(0,1);System.out.println("Union-find connects 0 and 1: "+(u.find(0)==u.find(1))+". Path compression makes future finds faster.\n");} public static void main(String[] args){run();}}
